t.com.my/amp/business/insight/2026/06/1454088/petrodollar-myth-and-real-foundations-american-power">New Straits Times — el mito del petrodólar (jun 2026)</a></li></ul><p class="" dir="auto" id="3e4a3eef-8de9-4765-9e75-c6636ef22ca1"><strong>Agua, alimentos y drones</strong></p><ul class="bulleted-list" dir="auto" id="ef9a8bfc-f7f8-43c9-b97c-16f9674fbf39"><li style="list-style-type:disc"><a href="https://rusi.org/commentary/gulfs-food-security-dilemma">RUSI — el dilema de la seguridad alimentaria del Golfo</a></li></ul><ul class="bulleted-list" dir="auto" id="32740e64-d859-44b5-ba6b-0a2d70891e5b"><li style="list-style-type:disc"><a href="https://aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/8/how-targeting-of-desalination-plants-could-disrupt-water-supply-in-the-gulf">Al Jazeera — cómo atacar desalinizadoras afectaría al agua del Golfo (8 mar 2026)</a></li></ul><ul class="bulleted-list" dir="auto" id="e80166e3-e8e9-4e80-bec5-cbc46e1684c0"><li style="list-style-type:disc"><a href="https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/6/2/how-the-war-has-made-irans-water-crisis-worse">Al Jazeera — cómo la guerra agrava la crisis del agua en Irán (2 jun 2026)</a></li></ul><ul class="bulleted-list" dir="auto" id="22b5b6bb-a16d-4afc-a34c-0e95a366913f"><li style="list-style-type:disc"><a href="https://www.sdg6data.org/en/indicator/6.4.2">SDG 6 Data — indicador 6.4.2, nivel de estrés hídrico</a></li></ul><ul class="bulleted-list" dir="auto" id="db702909-4752-4c9f-bb9b-8b0029d944ed"><li style="list-style-type:disc"><a href="https://newsweek.com/iran-lake-urmia-disappearing-water-crisis-2127726">Newsweek — el lago Urmia al borde de desaparecer (10 sep 2025)</a></li></ul><ul class="bulleted-list" dir="auto" id="f0c844e1-1d9c-4044-acfc-cff03c4011b8"><li style="list-style-type:disc"><a href="https://newsukraine.rbc.ua/news/bloomberg-evaluates-iran-s-capacity-to-produce-1773252510.html">RBC-Ukraine, citando a Bloomberg — capacidad iraní de producción</a></li></ul><ul class="bulleted-list" dir="auto" id="324c326d-8196-